 stress difference function.
 Instantaneous elasticity has been handled with a finite but fast ramp
 towards the constant stress value.
 The model is but now with an elastoviscoplastic model:
 SRM1 (Saramito 2007) or SRM2 (Saramito 2009). Single mode. 2D flow.
 The integration scheme is second-order Runge Kutta (Heun)

 Similar to startup29, but now with an elastoviscoplastic model:
 SRM1 (Saramito 2007) or SRM2 (Saramito 2009). Single mode.

